	<header class="entry-header">
		<h1 class="entry-title">Kentucky Briefings April 15th and 22nd</h1>	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	
	
	<div class="entry-content">
					<p>Along with a great cast of MS partners, evangelists, specialists and more I will be bringing <a href="http://expression.microsoft.com/en-us/ee722034.aspx" target="_blank">Sketchflow</a> to the Frankfort, KY area Thursday, April 15th.&#160; This will be Session I with Session II scheduled for April 22nd.&#160; You can learn about everything from <a href="http://www.microsoft.com/forefront/clientsecurity/en/us/default.aspx" target="_blank">Forefront Suite</a> to <a href="http://www.microsoft.com/silverlight/" target="_blank">Silverlight</a> to <a href="http://www.windowsphone7series.com/" target="_blank">Windows Phone 7</a> and, of-course, <a href="http://expression.microsoft.com/en-us/ee722034.aspx" target="_blank">Sketchflow</a>.&#160; </p>
<p>You can find registration and session schedules in <a href="http://samples.cromwellhaus.com/KY Briefings April Ver 1.2.pdf" target="_blank">here (pdf)</a>.</p>
<p>Looking forward to seeing everyone there.</p>
					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

